135
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Who is the DBM representative?

136
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:24,000
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Director La Bastilla.

137
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:26,000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Director La Bastilla.

138
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sige po, Director.

139
00:09:30,100 --> 00:09:32,620
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Ganda ang hapon po, Your Honor.

140
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:40,500
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: We will be checking po yung sa DTI and other agencies kasi we're handling po yung sa DOST.

141
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:42,720
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Definitely though, it is one of the lowest.

142
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:42,980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Right?

143
