145
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:57,660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we were able to achieve the target of at least 4% of GDP.

146
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:03,740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'm sure science and technology research also has a prescribed 1%.

147
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang layo natin sa 1%.

148
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:07,920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We're at 0.3.

149
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:10,480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So maybe progressively over the years,

150
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we can try to find ways to augment.

151
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So pagkatapos po ng presentation ninyo,

152
