Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: if there were priorities that we could,

156
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: for augmentation,

157
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: could also mention that, Secretary.

158
00:10:28,340 --> 00:10:31,640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung may top two or three items for augmentation,

159
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:34,240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: feel free to talk about it.

160
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi ko po pinapangako na matutupad yan,

161
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:37,800
