162
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:42,540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: alam po natin yung mga pangunahing target ninyo after the NEP.

163
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:44,200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We all know that after the NEP,

164
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:47,520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: meron pa namang space sana to be able to augment.

165
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So we can also talk about that later on.

166
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:50,880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sige po, you have the floor.

167
